# Code (and mock-ups) BSD-3-Clause; documentation CC-BY-4.0 (D-41, NOTICE.md).
license:
  - BSD-3-Clause
  - CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/0ffrian/SphereX"
# The main data sources the software uses. Licences, terms and acknowledgement texts are in NOTICE.md.
# Every entry with a DOI was checked against its DOI record (Crossref or DataCite) on 24 Nov 2026.
# SkyBoT and Horizons have no DOI: they are cited as each service asks on its own page (checked the same day).
# "et al." marks an author list cut short; the full lists are in the DOI records.
